# Frontend

- i18n: add keys to **both** `src/i18n/locales/ko.ts` and `en.ts`; use `useI18n().t` for user-visible strings
- Map backend codes with `mapBackendMessage` / env codes with `mapEnvCode` — do not show raw KO from Rust in the UI
- Settings helpers live in `src/types/settings.ts`; persist via `settingsService.ts`
- Tests: pure helpers with vitest (`npm test`); no Tauri mock E2E in scope by default
- Preserve existing dark UI / layout patterns; avoid generic redesign unless asked
- Zustand store + hooks pattern (`useDownloadActions`, `useDownloadEvents`) — keep new flow consistent
